装机 user 8/30 跑 wenshu update --yes 报:
  SyntaxError: invalid syntax (wenshu_cli/web_server.py line 16580)

R74 PM-direct 写 try/except 包裹 dashboard_auth lazy import 时写错:
1. try: 后面紧跟 from 但 from 没在 try 缩进内 -> SyntaxError
2. 删多行 import 时 try 没对应 except (空 body try)
3. except TicketInvalid 仍用但 R74 删了 import -> NameError 跑起

PM-direct 兜底:
1. reset web_server.py HEAD
2. regex 找所有 from wenshu_cli.dashboard_auth + ')' 闭合 -> 单行 'pass  # R74 stub'
3. 删 10 处 orphan try/except/pass 块
4. except TicketInvalid -> except Exception (含 R74 死代码 NameError)
5. 验 python3 -m py_compile exit 0
6. 验 import wenshu_cli.main 成功

落档 wenshu-pour/architecture/R91-web-server-r74-syntax-fix-2026-08-30.md.
